#This file contains the mapping between technology layers and lefdef layers.
#
#Same sky130 LEF <-> QRC name mismatch as sky130_qrc_layer.map (li1/li,
#met*/metal*, via/via1), but in the 4-column format Voltus takes via
#set_pg_library_mode -lef_layer_map. See sky130_qrc_layer.map for the details.

#layer type	tech layer name		lefdef layer name
#
#li is a POLY-type conductor in the QRC tech file (line 258), not a metal. Declaring it
#"metal" makes voltus_libgen abort with VOLTUS_LGEN-3228, and letting Voltus auto-map
#instead pairs LEF li1 with QRC metal1 and shifts every metal up by one (met5 falls off
#the end). Verified 2026-09-19.

poly	li	lefdef	 li1
via	mcon	lefdef	 mcon
metal	metal1	lefdef	 met1
via	via1	lefdef	 via
metal	metal2	lefdef	 met2
via	via2	lefdef	 via2
metal	metal3	lefdef	 met3
via	via3	lefdef	 via3
metal	metal4	lefdef	 met4
via	via4	lefdef	 via4
metal	metal5	lefdef	 met5
